  "kind": "gf-retail-type5-sibling-exits",
  "notes": ["Original constructors allocate the parent; phase one, HP, timer, position and contact latch are declared inputs.","Factory arguments and full allocation are observed from the same saved inlet, not as two game events.","The contact latch wins over zero HP or expiry. Refusing the area does not fall back to type 4 even with its required pools available.","Actor contact uses the saved point except for type 77, which uses the carrier root. The bounds guard is not a replay of the separate stage probe.","No actor overlap, area opening, HP writer, live action or native gameplay runs in these cases."],
